.nf
YASMV manual                                                 settings

SYNOPSIS
  settings list
  settings show NAME
  settings set NAME VALUE
  settings reset NAME
  settings save

DESCRIPTION
.fi
Typed preferences for the interactive shell. Available settings:
check.timeout (default 30s): duration in ms, s, m, h, or unlimited.
check.execution (default sync): sync or async.
check.progress.max_states (default 10000): integer from 1 to 1000000.

set changes the session. reset selects the built-in default in this session.
save persists the effective overrides to $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/yasmv/settings.json
(or ~/.config/yasmv/settings.json). Inspection shows values and their sources.
Unknown settings and invalid values fail without modifying settings.

Precedence: command option, session, saved user preference, built-in default.
Commands capture their settings when submitted; existing jobs never change.
Structured APIs do not load interactive preferences. Model input bindings
continue to use set/get and are unrelated to these settings.

EXAMPLES
  settings set check.timeout 5m
  settings set check.execution async
  settings save
  check invariant SAFE -sync -wall-ms 60000
